WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two choices. You point to one. The record should be simple.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
But what if the thing you were handed wasn't what you chose?

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
In a 2005 experiment, some people explained an altered result.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
That does not mean every choice is unreliable. It means explanations need records.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try writing your reason before you decide to buy an audio program.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the independent evidence guide, or start free with the Focus Fieldbook.
